	(text "TODO\n- EPROM even/odd bank: A16-A1 -> A15-A0 of each chip, D0-D7 / D8-D15\n- SRAM even bank CS includes A0, odd bank CS includes BHE\n- Chip selects come from 'I/O decoding' sheet (EPROM: A19-A17 = 111; SRAM: A19-A16 = 0000, M/IO = 1)\n- Physical build: W27C512 in DIP sockets"
